1
00:00:13,279 --> 00:00:14,679
I truly love China,

2
00:00:15,839 --> 00:00:17,039
and I am very fond of Rongcheng.

3
00:00:18,359 --> 00:00:19,679
So rest assured, everyone.

4
00:00:20,239 --> 00:00:21,559
I will increase our investments

5
00:00:22,079 --> 00:00:24,120
to promote trade between China and Japan.

6
00:00:25,239 --> 00:00:26,320
As for profit sharing,

7
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:27,760
thirty percent for us, seventy for you.

8
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:30,760
He's really going all out.

9
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:34,240
President Lian, what do you think?

10
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:37,600
What does everyone else think?

11
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,479
Doing business with the Japanese is treason, isn't it?

12
00:00:40,359 --> 00:00:41,520
"Trade cooperation"?

13
00:00:42,439 --> 00:00:44,439
What could Japan possibly ship to Rongcheng?

14
00:00:45,039 --> 00:00:46,359
Cotton yarn and silk,

15
00:00:46,799 --> 00:00:48,399
to crush Rongcheng's textile industry?

16
00:00:49,039 --> 00:00:50,119
Or candy and canned goods,

17
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,359
to destroy Rongcheng's food industry?

18
00:00:53,759 --> 00:00:55,119
Or opium and gunpowder,

19
00:00:55,479 --> 00:00:56,960
to destroy our homes in Rongcheng?

20
00:01:01,399 --> 00:01:04,159
President Lian, that's uncalled for.

21
00:01:04,719 --> 00:01:06,079
I am a friendly merchant who loves China.

22
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:09,439
I'd never harbor such malicious thoughts.

23
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:12,359
The Japanese slaughtered 300,000 of our compatriots in Nanjing!

24
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:13,799
Their crimes are heinous,

25
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:15,959
too numerous to count.

26
00:01:16,319 --> 00:01:18,599
And now you dare try to infiltrate Rongcheng?

27
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,599
Drop your hypocritical act!

28
00:01:21,319 --> 00:01:22,400
As long as I live,

29
00:01:22,959 --> 00:01:23,799
the Matsui Chamber of Commerce

30
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:26,120
won't lay a single finger on Rongcheng's trade!

31
00:01:31,519 --> 00:01:32,079
Let's go.

32
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,239
Come out.

33
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:01,840
You didn't kill anyone.

34
00:02:02,519 --> 00:02:03,359
Why run?

35
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,000
And wait for you to drag me to the police station?

36
00:02:10,599 --> 00:02:12,039
We at the police department aren't that stupid.

37
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,159
Who the killer is

38
00:02:16,439 --> 00:02:17,319
is plain as day.

39
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:23,759
You went to the Sanshan Gang.

40
00:02:25,199 --> 00:02:25,919
Find anything?

41
00:02:26,639 --> 00:02:27,719
Your Sanshan Gang

42
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:29,639
seems to have let some vermin slip in.

43
00:02:33,159 --> 00:02:35,000
What do you really want from me?

44
00:02:37,719 --> 00:02:38,680
I want to

45
00:02:41,319 --> 00:02:42,919
catch a rat in a trap.

46
00:02:59,439 --> 00:03:00,319
Mr. Matsui.

47
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,560
Long time no see.

48
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:07,759
Instead of running for your life,

49
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:09,560
what are you doing here?

50
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:12,159
I'm here to finish this game of chess with you.

51
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:15,439
Very well.

52
00:03:16,199 --> 00:03:17,599
Since you're so eager to lose,

53
00:03:18,199 --> 00:03:19,199
I'll gladly oblige.

54
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:44,800
The one who shot at me three years ago,

55
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,159
and the one who killed

56
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,960
Deputy Director Zhou half a year ago...

57
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:52,680
It was you, wasn't it?

58
00:03:57,599 --> 00:03:59,039
You're tougher to kill than Zhou Kun.

59
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,719
Creating a diversion,

60
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:07,080
assassinating Mr. He, the overseas Chinese,

61
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,560
and sending me away from the Sanshan Gang...

62
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:13,199
It was all to give the killer

63
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:17,120
a chance to assassinate Chief Hu, wasn't it?

64
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:19,839
That's right.

65
00:04:25,879 --> 00:04:27,120
I'm curious, though.

66
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,680
How did you convince Zhuang Liancheng?

67
00:04:32,199 --> 00:04:32,800
Hall Master Zhuang,

68
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,240
are you truly content

69
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:37,759
spending your life under Lian Ye,

70
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:42,040
even calling him Chief one day?

71
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:44,439
You're his equal,

72
00:04:45,199 --> 00:04:46,759
yet you outshine him at every turn.

73
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:50,519
Soon, the Japanese army will advance in force,

74
00:04:51,199 --> 00:04:53,800
and Rongcheng will be ours for the taking.

75
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:58,279
If Hall Master Zhuang helps the Japanese army,

76
00:04:59,519 --> 00:05:02,360
your rise to power will be right around the corner.

77
00:05:10,279 --> 00:05:11,759
I'm at Mr. Matsui's command.

78
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:17,879
When did you

79
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,959
realize Zhuang Liancheng was the killer?

80
00:05:23,199 --> 00:05:25,360
The first to realize Zhuang Liancheng was the killer

81
00:05:25,959 --> 00:05:26,720
wasn't me.

82
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,680
It was Hu Baozhu.

83
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,120
The stab wound on the Chief's body

84
00:05:32,759 --> 00:05:34,480
slanted from bottom right to top left,

85
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,560
proving the killer was left-handed.

86
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:37,959
And I'm right-handed.

87
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:40,759
Baozhu knew at a glance I wasn't the killer.

88
00:05:41,319 --> 00:05:43,079
So the next day, when she went to Club Jasmine...

89
00:05:43,079 --> 00:05:44,759
Lian Ye, you listen to me!

90
00:05:45,279 --> 00:05:46,839
If Hall Master Zhuang hadn't told us

91
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:49,120
my father lost his temper meeting the Japanese,

92
00:05:49,759 --> 00:05:51,480
and if we hadn't gone to comfort him

93
00:05:52,199 --> 00:05:53,360
and exposed your scheme,

94
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:56,720
you really would've gotten away with it!

95
00:05:57,519 --> 00:05:58,399
Making everyone believe

96
00:05:58,399 --> 00:05:59,839
that I was the one who killed the Chief.

97
00:05:59,839 --> 00:06:00,680
Killing two birds with one stone,

98
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,839
to drive me out of the Sanshan Gang.

99
00:06:05,959 --> 00:06:08,199
Between Zhuang Liancheng and Hu Baozhu,

100
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,800
whose throwing daggers are deadlier?

101
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:14,360
Baozhu,

102
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,519
what's the meaning of this?

103
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,800
I'm here to avenge my father, of course.

104
00:06:21,399 --> 00:06:23,360
You think I murdered the Chief?

105
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:25,040
Where's your proof?

106
00:06:26,199 --> 00:06:26,800
Come out!

107
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,439
Hall Master Lian, the Chief asks for you.

108
00:06:32,879 --> 00:06:34,000
It was Hall Master Zhuang

109
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,120
who told me to notify Hall Master Lian

110
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,720
to meet with the Chief alone.

111
00:06:37,759 --> 00:06:39,040
My father's wound showed

112
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:41,759
the killer was left-handed. It was you

113
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:44,040
who caught him off guard and killed him!

114
00:06:44,199 --> 00:06:45,120
Go join your father!

115
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:12,800
So what if you killed Zhuang Liancheng?

116
00:07:13,399 --> 00:07:15,240
My men have already infiltrated the Sanshan Gang.

117
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:18,600
Has fortune arrived?

118
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,079
I-It's arrived.

119
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:30,399
Has fortune arrived?

120
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:32,160
N-No, it hasn't.

121
00:07:39,519 --> 00:07:40,800
Did you think the Sanshan Gang...

122
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:42,759
...was so easy to infiltrate?

123
00:07:51,279 --> 00:07:52,120
Has fortune arrived?

124
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:54,160
F-Fortune has always been here!

125
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,319
I know what you're afraid of.

126
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:58,160
Come here.

127
00:07:59,839 --> 00:08:01,639
Question them dock by dock.

128
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:02,920
If the secret code is wrong,

129
00:08:03,319 --> 00:08:04,040
execute them immediately.

130
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,040
Yes, sir! Right away!

131
00:08:05,759 --> 00:08:06,120
Move!

132
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:07,839
I already told Wang Dali

133
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:10,199
to pass the secret code to our Sanshan Gang brothers.

134
00:08:10,959 --> 00:08:13,759
Any Pingtan refugee entering the Sanshan Gang

135
00:08:14,759 --> 00:08:16,120
who doesn't know the code

136
00:08:17,319 --> 00:08:18,560
will be executed on the spot.

137
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:25,800
Sachiko.

138
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:28,720
Clean the room and toss this trash far away.

139
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:30,360
Yes, sir.

140
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:37,759
Even if you kill our men, it's too late.

141
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,240
After tonight,

142
00:08:42,559 --> 00:08:44,639
all of you will be prisoners of the Japanese!

143
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,960
You kept checking the clock just now.

144
00:08:48,559 --> 00:08:49,799
Were you waiting for ten o'clock,

145
00:08:51,519 --> 00:08:53,240
when the Japanese army launches their night raid?

146
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,600
To storm the city?

147
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:04,159
We already interrogated your Japanese spies.

148
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,960
We know all about your plan to strike from both inside and out.

149
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:09,600
That signal flare just now...

150
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,960
wasn't fired by a Japanese spy.

151
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,840
My men fired it.

152
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:21,840
So what?

153
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:24,519
The Major General has mobilized overwhelming forces,

154
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,600
more than enough to take Rongcheng!

155
00:09:27,159 --> 00:09:28,000
Don't you forget,

156
00:09:29,639 --> 00:09:31,759
Li Mingyuan is no pushover.

157
00:09:43,039 --> 00:09:43,960
Well fought!

158
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,159
Mingyuan,

159
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:50,279
how did you know

160
00:09:50,559 --> 00:09:52,200
the Japanese would launch a night raid tonight?

161
00:09:52,759 --> 00:09:53,559
While investigating a case,

162
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:54,960
I ran into some Pingtan refugees.

163
00:09:55,159 --> 00:09:57,159
Their accents didn't sound like Pingtan locals,

164
00:09:57,559 --> 00:09:58,559
sounding more like Japanese instead.

165
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:00,399
I looked into it and found out

166
00:10:00,879 --> 00:10:01,799
that Japanese agents

167
00:10:01,799 --> 00:10:03,320
were posing as Pingtan refugees

168
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:04,360
to infiltrate the Sanshan Gang.

169
00:10:05,159 --> 00:10:07,000
So I captured a Japanese spy and interrogated him.

170
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,399
That Japanese spy

171
00:10:08,399 --> 00:10:10,039
confessed to tonight's night raid.

172
00:10:12,519 --> 00:10:15,039
Thanks to your timely intel this time,

173
00:10:15,559 --> 00:10:17,399
we caught the Japanese in one fell swoop

174
00:10:17,759 --> 00:10:18,440
and spared Rongcheng

175
00:10:19,399 --> 00:10:20,360
from the flames of war.

176
00:10:23,879 --> 00:10:24,639
General...
